window.products.push({"id":918277,"name":"Cohas Matte White Labels for Beer Growler in Rectangle Shape includes Liquid Chalk Marker and 30 Labels, Fine Tip, Copper Marker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cnA4RgTuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cohas Chalkboard System Labels are made from material that looks like classic whiteboards, but will stick to any smooth surface. These growler labels are just the right size for 16 and 32 ounce glass beer, beverage, and essential oil containers! They come with no design on the label, giving you have the entire area for your homemade lettering or illustration. This kit comes with a liquid chalk marker that is semi-permanent and waterproof. The premium marker features a fine 1mm tip, perfect for making thin chalk-like lines about 1/32-inches wide. The marker's waterproof ink means it cannot be removed with water - even soapy water or in the dishwasher! This makes them great for labeling beverage and liquid containers. When you are ready to change your labels, just use Windex with ammonia or a non-abrasive kitchen cleaner. This product is not recommended for children to use.  Labels are easy to clean and reuse, and are guaranteed to stick to your glassware or containers. They also adhere to ceramics, wood, steel, aluminum, porcelain, plastics, or other smooth non-porous surfaces. Remove with gentle heat from a hair dryer. Labels and markers are not recommended for painted walls; use our removable Cohas Chalkboard System Boards for decorating your walls or painted surfaces.  Ziggyboard has now become Cohas! Still providing the same products and customer service you’ve come to know and love, but under a new name! And new to the change, Cohas products purchased through authorized resellers come with a one-year warranty! Safe in your home. Markers have the CE mark, meet Toy Safety Regulation EN-41, and bear AP Seal ASTM D4236.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cnA4RgTuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cohas","source_asin":"B01N5PBUXU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5PBUXU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5PBUXU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
