window.products.push({"id":918292,"name":"Koyal Wholesale Gauze Cheesecloth Napkins for Wedding Table Decorations, Reception Table Settings, Serving and Dining, Home Décor, 10-Pack, Mauve, 20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OroO3N8JS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Cotton Complete your table décor with gauze napkins. Sold as 10 napkins per set, with each napkin size 20\" x 20\", these gauze, also known as cheesecloth napkins, are the perfect size to be placed center of each plate. Each textured napkin is made of high quality. Plan an intimate dinner, add a shabby chic touch of style with gauze napkins, and include a cheesecloth table runner for an extra touch. Order in bulk for your wedding, anniversary, retirement, engagement, or next holiday dinner. These gauze napkins are a sheer, textured fabric that is soft to the touch. Available in 3 colors: blush pink, mauve, and gray. Made from lightweight material, these napkins are perfect for rustic style weddings, Mother's Day brunches, and family dinners. A more stylish way to set your table, using gauze napkins adds a special touch over the other napkin types. Reusable and sustainable, gauze napkins are made from an easy-to-clean material. Simply wash on delicate or by hand. Place dusty rose gauze napkins at each place setting as the final touch to your rustic tablescape. The soft material adds a delicate touch and each color can pair with several wedding decor styles. The boho-chic reception will be complete by adding cheesecloth material to your guest tables. If a farmhouse wedding is your theme, choose one of the three colors to compliment your reception decorations. Cheesecloth table napkins along with a boho-chic tablescape is perfect for a country wedding. Dress up your dining table with full place settings and beautiful gauze napkins. Sold as a pack of 10, your dinner table is complete with mauve, blush pink or gray colors. Host an elegant garden theme dinner or arrange your table with a farmhouse, rustic theme. The lightweight cloth is washable and easy to maintain. Use a cheesecloth table or a gauze runner for holiday dinners Christmas, Thanksgiving, Easter, Mother's Day, or your NYE dinner. Gauze napkins have more use than just wedding table decor. The textured material photographs beautifully as a backdrop for food photography. Place food products on top of blush pink or gray gauze cloth napkin along with other photography props for the perfect shot. Use the option to order in bulk for special events. The perfect choice for hosting at home, use cheesecloth as decoration for table centerpieces. With your runner table cloth, complete the look with these 20\" x 20\" napkins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OroO3N8JS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koyal Wholesale","source_asin":"B091G8XV6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091G8XV6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091G8XV6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
