window.products.push({"id":918535,"name":"KwikSafety Anti-Skid Safe Traction Stair Treads Black | Increase Resistance on Trailers Boats Ramps Workshops Poolside w/Durable Non Slip 60 Grit Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j-kMg2STL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes to safety in your home or workplace, stairs and step areas should never be overlooked. Applying abrasive anti slip treads is one of the best choices you can make to help prevent slips and falls. This KwikSafety non-slip stair tread is great for indoor and outdoor usage. Whether it's to make a loading dock more secure, or just to have peace of mind on your front steps, KwikSafety can help reduce slips and falls. This 5 pack of Commercial Grade 60-grit, 6”x24” strips provides superior grip. Adhesive: Removable self-adhesive Tape - Peel off with hands or scarper. We utilize a heavy duty adhesive design to allow for application of the grip tape over many different surfaces. However, a clean, dry and smooth surface is essential. Cleaning surface with acetone will remove all contaminants without leaving a residue. Very smooth & high gloss surfaces should be lightly scuffed using a wet & dry abrasive pad or sand paper followed by cleaning. Weather resistant so you can be safe when you need it most. These durable treads effectively help prevent slip-and-fall hazards, while providing an abrasive surface that is built to last and withstand heavy foot traffic. Even in adverse conditions, such as when wet, icy, or dirty, the KwikSafety Non-Slip Stair Treads are designed to increase slip resistance on stairways, slopes or ramps, ladders, poolside steps, boat decks, workshops and trailers to help reduce slips and falls. May be used for construction, hazard, and slippery environments, indoor or outdoor. If you did order the wrong size we offer Hassle Free Returns within 30 days if your item was shipped via Amazon FBA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j-kMg2STL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KwikSafety","source_asin":"B01CFUZWU0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CFUZWU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CFUZWU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
