window.products.push({"id":918552,"name":"Le Sens Amazing Home Jar Candle Holder Set House Decor Centerpiece 11 inches, Festive Wedding Rustic Family Candles Marriage Ceremony Jar Candles Burl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91t9++SlrfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These glass Jar candles are wrapped in aesthetic, very rustic looking rope and adorned with burlap lace and dry flowers, this Jar candle set is the perfect addition for your rustic weddings or home decor. The glass cup candles are 3.5 inches(9 cm) tall and 2.7 inches(7 cm) wide. The steel tray is 11 inches (28 cm) wide and 0.78 inch(2 cm) tall. With a hint of Art Deco design, our rustic tray is an artistic piece for a grouping of candle and pinecones– and a few natural objects for added drama. The tray is made of steel with a powder-coated black dull polish finish. Not food safe; for decorative use only. Featuring nature-inspired scent, this rustic candle set centerpiece makes a lovely Mother's Day, shower or bridal shower gift. Packaged in dried Flowers-decorated metal tray, the soy-blend candles feature aromatic blends: black tea essence. These jar candles are encompassed in beautiful glass to provide ambience to any room that needs something a little extra. Poured into a stylish electrofacing glass vessel, our Glass Candles add a touch of glam and glow wherever they go. Trim wicks to 1/4\" and burn no longer than 4 hours at a time. Wipe clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91t9++SlrfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Sens Amazing Home","source_asin":"B08KZFDD44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZFDD44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZFDD44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":918553,"name":"Chef's Masterpiece II Wall Decor by Lisa Audit, 14 by 32\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxTndAW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a chef presenting a cup of coffee on a multi-patterned background. Lisa audit loves the art of decoration, and she uses oil paints, acrylics, and pen and ink to create beautiful pieces of art. She finds inspiration from fine art masters such as Picasso, Manet, Rubens and Cezanne. Lisa lives in Canada with her two teenage daughters, and she creates much of her artwork in a spacious studio inside her home. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxTndAW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00XQZ2NGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XQZ2NGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XQZ2NGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
