window.products.push({"id":918574,"name":"BoTaiDaHong 3000W Electric Commercial Grill Griddle Flat Hotplate Temperature Adjustable Stainless Steel Nonstick Large Cooking Surface Restaurant Gri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uV5AqkkPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The commercial quality Electric Griddle Cooktop boasts 3000 watts of cooking power. Versatility to cook everything from pancakes to stir-fry’s. With a large 548x350mm cooking surface you can serve customers with speed or feed your hungry family in one go. Forget washing up multiple fry pans the electric griddle cooktop is all you need. Featuring large grease drip tray for easy cleaning as you cook and simple clean up when you’re done. Thermostat control adjusts between 50-300ᵒC for precise cooking temperature teamed with thick food grade stainless steel cooking plate for fast even heat distribution so you can cook to perfection. Ideal for use in cafes or canteens the sleek design will blend into any kitchen. Never worry about running out of gas or having to lug the big BBQ out, the electric griddle is all you need for your next sausage sizzle or kids sports carnival cook-up. Safety features such as overload circuit breaker for your peace of mind. Non-slip rubber feet will make sure the cooktop stays secure while you cook. Order your Electric Griddle Cooktop Today! 304 food grade stainless steel cooking surface Thermostat control Even heat distribution Splash guards Non-slip rubber feet Removable grease tray Overload circuit breaker CE certification Specification Power: 3000W Plug: （without） Voltage: 110V / 60Hz Cooking area: 548 x 350mm Food plate material: A30 steel, 8mm thickness Body structure:  (top) 304 food grade  stainless steel, (bottom, which include drawers) 430 stainless steel Overload circuit breaker: Yes Temperature range: 50-300 degrees celcius","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uV5AqkkPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BoTaiDaHong","source_asin":"B07XB11232","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XB11232","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XB11232","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":918575,"name":"Mila Air Purifier with Home Wrecker Filter (H12 HEPA + 1.96 lb Carbon), Filters VOCs, Formaldehyde, Odors, Dust, Pollution & Pet Dander, 300 CADR,  66","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":428.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2rLI5ONL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"👋 SAY HELLO TO MILA: You’ll always know exactly what your home air quality is and how long it’ll take to achieve your target air quality index (AQI), regardless of the size of your room. And, with the Home Wrecker 🚧 filter, tackle anything that may be lurking in your home with the filter designed with home renovators in mind. Mila is 100% ozone-free, complies with California Air Resources Board (CARB) for indoor cleaning devices, and is FCC certified and ETL listed. 💪 PROTECTING YOU FROM THAT “NEW HOME” SMELL: With a hefty 1.96 lb of specifically formulated carbon targeting formaldehyde and 45 ft2 of high-grade HEPA, the Home Wrecker makes sure the chemicals and odors from new paint, carpet, or furniture don’t linger, and slays with a 92.81% VOC removal rate (95.6% formaldehyde removal rate). The Home Wrecker also delivers a powerful clean air delivery rate (CADR) of 300 m3/hr, giving you the muscle to handle medium and large rooms up to 665 ft2. 🧠 SMART CONTROL: This modern home essential keeps you connected by showing you real-time air quality data and includes thoughtful features like Bubble Boy mode, to keep your AQI levels as low as possible, no matter what. Get real-time reads on your VOC levels and see how it trends directly from the app. And the best part is that Mila’s always getting smarter, with meaningful updates automatically delivered to you regularly. Available on iOS, Android. Works with Amazon Alexa and Google Home. 🤫 WHISPER QUIET: Air breathers, rejoice. Mila is the first air purifier that’s smart enough to quiet down when you're in the room (24 dB - like a library) and deep clean when you're away. This HEPA and carbon air purifier for homes comes loaded with thoughtful features like Sleep and Whitenoise Modes, Energy Save Mode, Turndown Service and a built-in Child Lock. 🤗 SUPER CUTE TO BOOT: With clean lines, cute curves, and the most adorable little bamboo legs, Mila is a contemporary home/apartment essential. This smart air cleaner also includes 8 environmental sensors, including a life-saving CO sensor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D2rLI5ONL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mila","source_asin":"B09K7CD8XS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7CD8XS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7CD8XS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
