window.products.push({"id":918640,"name":"Premium Black Photo Album | Scrapbook Photo Album with Writing Space | 100 Pages for Multiple Photo Sizes, 4x6, 5x7, 6x8, 8x10 | Acid Free Photo Album","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Bq6IL-VuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY LARGE CAPACITY ALBUM : this photo album measures at 11.8” (W) x 13” (H) x 2.1” (Thick) and with 50 sheets (100 pages) it can hold hundreds of photos, tickets, certificates and more. You will receive 240 free corner stickers with your purchase (enough for 60 photos) and more can be bought from our store if needed. PHOTO ALBUM WITH WRITING SPACE: with a classic, vintage vibe our scrapbook photo album gives you more creative control by allowing open space to write notes, store photos, tickets, certificates and memorabilia of many shapes and sizes, 3x5, 4x6, 5x7, 6x8 and 8x10. Your photos are secured to the page with corner stickers, beautifully framing each photo or you can glue items in place without the stickers, if you like a more modern feel. DURABLE AND MADE TO LAST : these picture albums are sturdy, durable and acid-free ensuring your photos are looked after for years to come. All precious memories stored and displayed in your personal way, this picture book for photos will hold up to a maximum of 500 images for any cherished moment. THE PERFECT GIFTABLE PHOTO ALBUM : this makes the ideal gift for family and friends for a birthday, as a wedding album, an anniversary gift , Christmas and any other special occasion. Made to a high quality with a timeless gold stamped logo and textured cover, it is a beautiful way to showcase your precious memories. TIMELESS STYLE: These photo albums are perfect if you want to showcase your memories with timeless style. We think you will love this photo album but if you are not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, please reach out to us via email and we will do our very best to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Bq6IL-VuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Lente","source_asin":"B0BN8DDYJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN8DDYJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN8DDYJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
