window.products.push({"id":918685,"name":"Ice Trays for Freezer with Lid, Silicone Ice Cube Trays with Lid and Bin, 26 Ice Cube Mold with Large Capacity Container, Scoop for Cocktails, Whiskey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MhMOGEFWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAVING SPACE】: Our product is a combination of an ice cube tray and an ice cube bucket with lid and scoop. All parts are compact which will not take lots of your space in freezer. You can empty the ice tray and store ice cubes underneath to make another tray of ice which is handy. 【FUN SHAPES】: Instead of making uniform rectangular shapes, our ice cube mold using a honeycomb shape to makes distinguish ice cubes which is fun and unique. One tray can make 26pcs cubes and each cube is around 0.65oz. 【EASY TO RELEASE】: YECERCAN ice cube mold with lid and bin is made of food grade silicone and PP material which is safe and durable. The tray is made of soft silica gel which makes it easy to remove the ice cubes. No need hard twist, just press the bottom , the cubes will pop out easily. This will save your time for enjoying your cold drinks. 【EASY TO CLEAN】: The ice trays for freezer is dishwasher safe, and you can also wash it by running water or soft wet cloth after using it for making fruit ice cubes. 【WITH LID TO KEEP ICE FRESH】: There comes with a lid of our silicone ice cube tray which will keep the ice clean and fresh. And the lid will prevent other flavors of the freezer from getting into the ice, and it can also helps to keep away from crumbs and other dropping things. The mold lip is 6mm above the tray so that you don’t get overflow to mess up your freezer. Now enjoy your pure ice cubes for your whiskey, cocktails and other summer mixed cold drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MhMOGEFWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YECERCAN","source_asin":"B0B1J3BST9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1J3BST9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1J3BST9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
