window.products.push({"id":918798,"name":"Electric Handheld Milk Frother - Caprilla Italiano, Cappuccino, Late, Chocolate drink Maker, Best for Making Smooth Foam for a Great Homemade Drink (6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UmnI6wsiL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Are you coffee lover that would like to enjoy barista Italian quality frothed milk in the comfort of your own home? Enter Caprilla Italiano, Caprilla Italiano will turn your milk or cream into rich delicious, frothy foam in seconds, that will transport you mentally to the Italian Countryside as you enjoy your home made cappuccinos and lattes that will leave you asking for more. This allows you to create fluffy and aerated milk based drinks (hot or cold) easily. Children love it too. Make your children foamy warm milk by itself, or perhaps with a little cinnamon and or honey added for a comforting before-bed treat.Handheld, Battery Operated Milk Frother Creates delicate foam for homemade lattes, cappuccinos, hot chocolates, and more! Stainless steel shaft and whip Easy to Operate and Clean. Operate the mixer - Insert frother whisk in a glass of hot or cold milk filled to 1/4 - Hold the frother at a slight angle - Turn on and move up and down - Turn off and enjoy a rich and smooth foam. To clean, use in warm soapy water and rinse. Powered by 2 AA batteries (not included) - 100% Satisfaction & 60 Day Money Back Guarantee! Use the milk frother /electric whisk with any type of milk - whole milk, almond milk, soy milk, coconut milk, or coffee creamer. This milk frother will work with it. Our Caprilla Italiano handheld electric milk frothers are super easy to use and to clean. Your friends will be impressed with your latte, cappuccino, foamed coffee drink making abilities. Hot chocolate is vastly better when it's prepared with foamy milk rather than water, so be sure to give that a try too. Stop overpaying for premium coffee drinks, or suffering with boring coffees at home. Get your Caprilla Italiano to your home today! Designed in Italy for the memorable moment. ORDER NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UmnI6wsiL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zoocura","source_asin":"B00VQLQMC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VQLQMC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VQLQMC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
