window.products.push({"id":918811,"name":"Style Quarters Waffle Grey Shower Curtain,Striped Waterproof Shower Curtains for Bathroom, Cotton Blend Heavy Duty Fabric Bath Curtain,Soft Luxury Spa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817sGj2pdDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ SUPERIOR QUALITY: Made of 55% cotton blend and 45% polyester.It is soft and comfortable to touch, waterproof, no smell, no-blowing, withstands moist bathroom.this waffle shower curtain is designed to keep your bathroom clean and dry while also adding a touch of sophistication to your decor. this shower curtain features a textured waffle weave that adds a touch of texture and dimension to your space,while the neutral colors ensure that it will complement any bathroom style. No liner required. Premium quality ensures long-lasting use. ✔ EXPERIENCE LUXURY AT HOME: White and gray striped shower curtain for bathroom complemented by stylish waffle-weave pattern adds elegance to your bathroom, offering you luxurious hotel bath at home. Instantly upgrades any bath to create a relaxing spa-like environment adding a natural and vibrant atmosphere to different bathrooms. ✔ EASY INSTALLATION: Each waffle shower curtain has 12 buttonholes which fit most curtain hooks. The 72x72 Inches white and gray shower curtain fits most standard-sized bathtubs and showers. Drapes beautifully for a clean, fresh look in your bathroom. This waffle striped shower curtain can be used in home, apartment, condo, hotel, RV, dorm room, school shower, athletic club, gym, bathroom，bathroom window curtain, party backdrop. ✔ EASY CARE: Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, Iron at low temperature. Line dry. PS.Because of the cotton waffle material,it may shrink a little bit after washing. Elegant drape with the extra-long size of 72\" x 72 \", fits your bathroom well. Simple & Contemporary: No chemical coating and smell, no fading, simple shower curtains for bathroom. ✔ CUSTOMER SUPPORT: Your satisfaction is our sole purpose! For any reason you are not 100% satisfied with our shower curtain, please contact us right away. Our hassle-free customer service team will work hard to resolve any issues that you have with this waffle shower curtain, each email from customers will be replied within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817sGj2pdDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SO OQ STYLE QUARTERS","source_asin":"B0BMTGK65H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTGK65H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTGK65H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
