window.products.push({"id":918826,"name":"Tribesigns Two Person Computer Desk with Bookshelf, 90 Inches Double Face-Face Workstation Desk with Storage Shelf for Two Person, Two Person Writing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PM8iJJokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Great Two Person Desk ] - Choosing the right two person desk for your office or home office can be pretty challenging, but Tribesigns double workstation computer desk will be a great solution for you and your partner. There are three installation ways to create different uses: extra large two person desk, double face to face workstation, single face to face desk with bookshelf. [ Different Installation Ways Create Versatile Use ] - The 90 Inch - Length size and three different installation allow 2 person to work side by side without compromising on space or you can sit face to face with your partner at the both side or the same side of bookshelf; The unique bookshelf design provide spacious space for storage while create two non-interference independent workspace that makes it’s space-saving and much more effective. [ Powerful Storage Function ] - A large desktop surface with a storage cube and bookshelf will provide ample storage space to hold books, your laptop or desktop PC and all of your office accessories confidently, keeps your things organized and easily accessible. It also could work as computer desk, computer table, writing desk, office desk, training table, dining table, meeting table, exhibition table etc just like you want. [ HIGH-QUALITY WITH PERFECT DETAILS ]- Durability is a key to the construction of the Tribesigns desk, that’s why we thicken and reinforced the metal legs to makes it more strong and stable, the desk panel is 2.5cm thick particle board with high glossy finish which is easy to clean and hold up to 325lb. The metal legs features adjustable leg pads, made the desks keep stable even on uneven floor. [ EASY TO ASSEMBLE ] - It will took 40 minutes to put together for most people with assembly instruction help. Don't worry about the Installation , it’s easy for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PM8iJJokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B082R4C7FP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082R4C7FP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082R4C7FP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
