window.products.push({"id":918964,"name":"Slate Wall Heater with Towel Bars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":375.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O9-qXgyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 operating power levels of 350w and 700w (~1200 and 2400 BTUH), this model can fully heat regular size bathrooms and mounts vertically on the bathroom wall. 5 colors available. There are 2 towel bars on the front allowing the warm stone to keep towels warm and dry. •w ~1200 BTUH / 700 w ~2400 BTUH (This equipment can work in two different power levels) •Size 19.30” x 31.11” x 6” (including towel bars) •Voltage 110 / 120v / 50-60Hz (Regular Outlet) •Weight 38 Lbs Measures and Shipping Information: Equipment Size: 19.30” x 31.11” x 6” including towel bars Equipment weight : 38 Lbs. How it works? Three heating systems (convection, accumulation and radiation) are combined within each device... The patented heat accumulation device called COMPACTTO TAD (compact granite high-density thermal minerals, HDT) achieves the most energy efficient levels in the market. A true GREEN PRODUCT. Products are UL certified. General mounting instructions: The bathroom heater can have the power outlet on the side or bottom. If a regular outlet is already installed close to the equipment, the best way to hide the cord is to have the power outlet beside the right or left side. The best way to hide the cord is installing a “recessed outlet” directly behind the heater so the plug disappears and the equipment will lay flat against the wall. The excess cord will then be placed in the holder on the back of the unit. The Bathroom Heater with towel warmer can be mounted against the wall at the height where regular towel bars would be installed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O9-qXgyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Climastar","source_asin":"B000XSNB0A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-918964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XSNB0A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XSNB0A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
